This tweet thread is the only direct interaction I ever had with Felix. But I loved his work and papers so much that I thought I would send him a note of encouragement a few months ago. I wish things were different now. May you rest in peace @FelixHill84
Quoting @SuryaGanguli
@FelixHill84 So sorry to hear this Felix! I hope you will continue to heal. One thought: come join us in academia! It is still a wonderful place to do fundamental science shared openly with the world.

